join Charity (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Charity (Warm)
Charity: Five. Exactly as he said.
- You made it happen
	Hope: You made it happen.
	Charity: I wrote a document. Sipho made it true before I wrote it, and Naledi is making it work now that it's here.
	Charity: That isn't modesty, it's accuracy. A case only ever describes something that already exists.
- And Unity Water?
	Hope: And Unity Water?
	Charity: They read it and did what they said they would, in the time they said they would do it.
	Charity: You would be astonished how much of this work is chasing people who did not. Unity Water have been the most dependable partner this village has, and I do not say that about many.
[signal arg="hearts:charity:1"]
set {GameState.quest_charity_proof_it_works_main} = "complete"
